  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientEventHubProducerClient wraps EventHubProducerClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Includes EventHubsTransientErrors helper with pre-built ShouldHandle predicate using EventHubsException.IsTransient, plus TimeoutException and TaskCanceledException. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
